	### The colonial subject list (Colonial Holdings): its column heads, then
	### one row per subject. Fixed cells, 28 + 134 + 38 + 34 + 66 + 72 + 80
	### and six 4 px gaps = 476, the territory rows' width. The flag is
	### vanilla's tiny_flag (the country's name on hover, the country on
	### click); the kind is vanilla's own subject-type icon, its name and why
	### it counts on hover. Liberty desire's head is vanilla's concept icon.
